Package: cowtype
Version: @VERSION@-1~@DISTRO@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: CowType contributors <0xarch@users.noreply.github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/0xarch/CowType
Depends: @SHLIBS@, fcitx5 (>= 5.1.11), python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.10), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5)
